2026-07-27T12:03:33.0512057Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T12:03:33.0512686Z i /tmp/RtmpQAPh9z/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:03:33.0513083Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:03:33.0513545Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:03:33.0513947Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:03:33.0514580Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:03:33.0515879Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:03:33.0516606Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T12:03:33.0778852Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
